---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Container from '../components/Container.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
---

<Base title="Privacy Policy">
  <PageHeader title="Privacy Policy" subtitle="Last updated: 30th October 2026" />
  <div class="w-full max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 md:py-16 space-y-8">
    <Container>
      <div class="text-[#4D4D4D] space-y-6">
        <p>This policy explains how Assemble Games handles information when you visit profootballerlife.com. It covers this website only, not the Pro Footballer Life game.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#1F1F1F] mt-6">1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>You can browse this website without creating an account or giving us your name or email address. We only receive:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc ml-6 mt-2">
          <li><strong>Messages you send us:</strong> if you email us, we receive your email address and whatever you include in your message.</li>
          <li><strong>Analytics data:</strong> information about how the website is used, as described in section 3.</li>
          <li><strong>Technical data:</strong> our hosting provider may process technical information such as your IP address so that it can deliver the website and keep it secure, as described in section 5.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#1F1F1F] mt-6">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>We use this information to:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc ml-6 mt-2">
          <li>Reply to your messages</li>
          <li>Understand how the website is used and improve it</li>
          <li>Keep the website running and secure</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not sell your personal information, and we do not use it for advertising.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#1F1F1F] mt-6">3. Website Analytics</h2>
        <p>We use Cloudflare Web Analytics to understand how visitors use this website, such as which pages are viewed, the referring website, browser and device type, and general location. It does not use cookies to do this. For more information, please refer to the <a class="underline" href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Cloudflare Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#1F1F1F] mt-6">4. Cookies</h2>
        <p>This website does not set cookies.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#1F1F1F] mt-6">5. Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>This website is hosted on <a class="underline" href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub Pages</a>, and its analytics are provided by Cloudflare. These providers handle data under their own privacy policies.</p>
        <p>We also link to other services, including Discord, TikTok, YouTube, X and Trello. Those services have their own privacy policies, which apply once you follow a link to them.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#1F1F1F] mt-6">6. How Long We Keep Information</h2>
        <p>We keep emails for as long as we need them to deal with your message and any follow-up, unless we have to keep them longer by law.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#1F1F1F] mt-6">7. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>Depending on where you live, you may have the right to access, correct or delete the personal information we hold about you, or to object to how we use it. You may also have the right to complain to your local data protection authority. To make a request, please contact us using the address below.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#1F1F1F] mt-6">8. Children</h2>
        <p>This website is not designed to collect personal information from children. If you believe a child has sent us personal information, please contact us and we will delete it.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#1F1F1F] mt-6">9. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this policy from time to time. We will post any changes on this page and update the "Last updated" date.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#1F1F1F] mt-6">10. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>If you have any questions about this policy, please contact us at <a class="underline" href="mailto:profootballerlife@gmail.com">profootballerlife@gmail.com</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </Container>
  </div>
</Base>
